    <string name="perm_confirm_enable">Enable Full access</string>
    <string name="perm_auto_confirm_title">Enable Auto review (experimental)?</string>
    <string name="perm_auto_confirm_desc">Auto review runs without a sandbox. Before every native tool call and PTC inner call, the same model as the current agent reviews whether to allow it; you approve or reject each call it denies. This feature is experimental, can falsely allow or deny actions, and uses additional tokens.</string>
